<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Equity Office started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Equity Office started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage Equity Office Properties Trust as intermediate accumulate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch was an underwriter of Equity Office's July 8 initial public offering.</p>
</text>
